{"id":"instinto","lemma":"instinto","pos":"noun","rank":2510,"glosses":["instinct","gut, gut feeling"],"ipa":"/insˈtinto/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"instintos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/73/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-instinto.wav","examples":[{"text":"Sigue tu instinto.","en":"Follow your instincts.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/821299","words":[{"g":"to follow","l":"seguir"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Mi instinto era cierto.","en":"My instinct was right.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77865","words":[{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a certain, a specific"}]},{"text":"Es uno de los instintos humanos básicos.","en":"It's one of the basic human instincts.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"one"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"human","l":"humano"},{"g":"basic","l":"básico"}]},{"text":"Los animales actúan por instinto.","en":"Animals act on instinct.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/703803","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"animal","l":"animal"},{"g":"to act, to behave","l":"actuar"},{"g":"for / by"},null]},{"text":"Tom siguió sus instintos.","en":"Tom followed his instincts.","words":[null,{"g":"to follow","l":"seguir"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null]}]}